OL,3,GNEWSATameside's missing #1m lottery
OL,4,Awinner claims prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a #1m lottery ticket
OL,7,Fbought in Greater Manchester has come
OL,8,Fforward to claim the prize.
OL,10,FThe hunt had been on to track down the
OL,11,Fwinner after the ticket was bought in
OL,12,FTameside in the summer, with the #1m
OL,13,Fprize due to expire in December.
OL,15,FBut after an appeal by the National
OL,16,FLottery, the millionaire-to-be has now
OL,17,Fcome forward to claim the life-changing
OL,18,Fprize, four months after the draw.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
